<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es-MX">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Calculadora de prestaciones y demanda laboral · LFT 2026</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f6f5f1;--card:#fff;--tx:#1d1d1b;--mut:#6b6a66;--bd:#dedcd5;--ac:#0f5c4a;--ac2:#e5f1ed;--wn:#8a5a00;--wnb:#fdf3dc;
